.TH "POWERLINE-LINT" "1" "Dec 23, 2025" "beta" "Powerline"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
powerline-lint \- Powerline configuration checker.
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
\fBpowerline\-lint\fP [\fB\-p\fP\fIPATH\fP]… [\fB\-d\fP]
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
\fB\-p\fP, \fB\-\-config\-path\fP \fIPATH\fP
Paths where configuration should be checked, in order. You must supply all paths necessary for powerline to work, checking partial (e.g. only user overrides) configuration is not supported.
.TP
\fB\-d\fP, \fB\-\-debug\fP
Display additional information. Used for debugging \fBpowerline\-lint\fP itself, not for debugging configuration.
.TP
\fB\-h\fP, \fB\-\-help\fP
Display help and exit.
.UNINDENT
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
.sp
Written by Kim Silkebækken, Nikolay Pavlov, Kovid Goyal and contributors. The glyphs in the font patcher are created by Fabrizio Schiavi.
.SH "گزارش باگ‌ها (REPORTING BUGS)"
.sp
Report powerline\-lint bugs to \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:powerline/\:powerline/\:issues>\&.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.sp
\fBpowerline(1)\fP, \fBpowerline\-config(1)\fP
